# LF in every checkout, whatever core.autocrlf says: Godot, odinfmt and our tools all write LF, so a CRLF checkout
# shows every file Godot rewrites as modified.
* text=auto eol=lf
# Read byte for byte: exported levels (src/level/README.md).
*.level binary
# Read byte for byte: replay regressions' recordings and expectations (src/headless/README.md, Replay regressions).
*.unil binary
*.unis binary
*.unie binary
# Godot's API dump (src/gdext/api/README.md): generated, kept out of diffs and language stats.
src/gdext/api/*.json linguist-generated=true -diff
# The one exception (src/cli/README.md, Line endings): cmd.exe misreads labels and goto in a batch file with LF line
# endings. Git applies both rules on checkout and commit.
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
